%% Outage and crash recovery (A04, G08).
flowchart LR
  subgraph Ingest
    A[Source outage detected<br/>circuit breaker opens] --> B[Status surfaced to UI<br/>bounded retry with backoff]
    B --> C[Source returns<br/>breaker half-open then closed]
  end
  subgraph Storage
    D[Process killed mid-append] --> E[Reopen log]
    E --> F[Scan frames from start]
    F --> G{Torn tail?}
    G -- yes --> H[Truncate to last intact frame]
    G -- no --> I[Keep all frames]
    H --> J[Rebuild dedup index]
    I --> J
  end
  subgraph Clients
    K[Client reconnects] --> L[Resume with last snapshot id + seq]
    L --> M{Snapshot current?}
    M -- yes --> N[Continue with deltas]
    M -- no --> O[Fresh snapshot]
  end
